  {
   "k": "1rjeb4e",
   "en": "Even if Hungary is unable to reform the Austro-Hungarian Empire, it is still possible for Germany to trigger its formation after it finishes the \"Rekindle Imperial Sentiment\" focus. To speed that up, you can boost your non-aligned ideology with a spy network in Czechoslovakia."
  },
  {
   "k": "2gtjlh",
   "en": "To better monitor the AI choices, build a spy agency and upgrade the economy/civilian branch. Get spies on both Germany and Hungary. When civilian intelligence is 50%, you can see which focuses they have taken. When it is 70%, you can see which focus they are currently working on."
  },
  {
   "k": "1hgxs2m",
   "en": "Be aware that because of the fact that historical AI is off Hungary could create the Pact of Rome and get in an early war (non-historical ⟦0⟧ sometimes justifies on ⟦1⟧ 1937) or tries to form A-H itself and then fails. So you might need a bit of luck for this strategy to succeed.",
